flowchart TD
    A[Client] --> B[Request Handler]
    B --> C[Coordinator (per request)]
    C --> D1[Replica A]
    C --> D2[Replica B]
    C --> D3[Replica C]

    subgraph Replica Write Path
        D1 --> E1[WAL / Commit Log]
        E1 --> F1[Memtable]
        F1 --> G1[Flush → SSTable]
    end

    subgraph Background
        G1 --> H1[Compaction]
    end

    C --> I[Wait for Consistency Level (QUORUM/ONE/ALL)]
    I --> J[Ack to Client]

    %% Read Path
    A --> R1[Read Request]
    R1 --> C
    C --> K1[Read from replicas]
    K1 --> L1[Memtable / Cache / SSTables]
    L1 --> M1[Merge + Reconcile Versions]
    M1 --> N1[Return Result]

    %% Repair
    M1 --> O1[Read Repair (optional)]
